WEBVTT

00:00:59.130 --> 00:01:00.997
because you're not safe.

00:01:01.030 --> 00:01:02.797
And I think from that point of view,

00:01:02.830 --> 00:01:06.997
this is now becoming
a collective global effort,

00:01:07.030 --> 00:01:11.263
when it comes to a post-pandemic world,
a post-COVID world,

00:01:11.297 --> 00:01:15.997
because we will need
to basically cooperate

00:01:15.997 --> 00:01:17.930
in terms of surveillance,

00:01:17.963 --> 00:01:21.597
in terms of prevention
and in terms of preparedness,

00:01:21.597 --> 00:01:24.197
in terms of future pandemics.

00:01:24.230 --> 00:01:27.663
So I think COVID-19
actually has demonstrated

00:01:27.697 --> 00:01:32.997
the importance of equitable
health care for all,